DESCRIPTION:Thursday Sunset Paddle &amp\; Party—with DJ BISH! Ease into 
 the evening with a relaxed paddle on the Petaluma River\, followed by dock
 side snacks and river community time. Once a month from April through Sept
 ember\, join The Floathouse crew for Thursday Sunset Paddle &amp\; Party .
  We’ll gather for a 5:30 pm-ish launch and paddle together into the soft
  evening light on Petaluma’s beautiful downtown river. And as a special 
 treat\, DJ Bish will be spinning some tunes on the dock! #block-df2044a01b
