SUMMARY:Taps at the Lodge
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260525
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260526
DTSTAMP:20260521T024905Z
UID:65q216hte2n6bkabc7po88db9h@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;VALUE=DATE:20260525
SEQUENCE:0
CREATED:20260511T210747Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><br></p><p><br></p><p>Join us this Memorial Day as we come 
 together in remembrance and community.</p><p>We invite musicians within ou
 r membership and the community at large to gather at the lodge at 2:00 PM 
 to</p><p>help set up and prepare. </p><p>At 3:00 PM\, we will unite in a 
 moment of honor as we play Taps together\, paying tribute to those who gav
 e everything for our freedom.</p><p>All are welcome…including non-musici
 ans…come be a part of this meaningful tradition.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260511T210842Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
