BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup: Rebel Craft Collective": "https://www.meetup.com/the-rebel-craft-collective/events/314772471/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_rebel_craft
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Rebel Craft Collective
UID:event_314772471@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260521T024848Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260806T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260806T193000
SUMMARY:Happy Hour Crafts
DESCRIPTION:The Rebel Craft Collective\nWine + tasty snacks + your latest project and a friendly group of likeminded crafters... what better way to unwind? Come join us!\n\nThis is a relaxed\, drop-in-friendly event. Come when you can\, leave when you must. Newcomers and occasional-comers are always welcome!\n\n**What do we mean by “crafts”?**\nWhatever “craft” means to you! And whatever is portable enough to bring to a wine bar. Knitting\, crochet\, and other fiber arts are most common\, but we have also warmly welcomed people who sketch\, color\, embroider\, bead\, and more. If your craft isn’t portable\, we will happily ooh and aah over photos of your work-in-progress\, or chat about your plans for your next project.\n\n**Health & Safety**\nMasks are very welcome\, and nobody will pressure you to eat or drink. If the weather is nice\, we will try to sit outside. If you aren’t eating/drinking during the event\, please consider ordering some of La Dolce Vita’s delicious food to-go\, in order to help support our gracious\, long-time venue.\n\n**Parking**\nParking in downtown Petaluma is free\, but street parking has a strictly enforced 2 hour limit until 6pm. To park for longer\, try the nearest garage:\n\n* The Second Street Garage entrance is located on C Street between First and Second Streets. It's all day parking on every level and a short walk to La Dolce Vita.\n\n**Ages**\nIt's a wine bar\, so this event is for adult crafters (though you're certainly not required to drink wine!). We’re okay with babes-in-arms if you are\, but this is not the right setting for wee crafters who are moving about on their own.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/the-rebel-craft-collective/events/314772471/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260513T184512Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260513T184512Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/a/2/b/3/600_527801651.jpeg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Griffo Distillery": "https://tockify.com/tom.l/detail/168/1786060800000"}
X-SOURCE-ID:griffo
X-SOURCE:Griffo Distillery
UID:TKF/66a1772a4da64542918f138b/168/29767680/0/0
DTSTART:20260807T000000Z
DTEND:20260807T050000Z
URL:https://tockify.com/tom.l/detail/168/1786060800000
SUMMARY: Scott Street Gin Jam: 1st & 3rd Thursdays EVERY Month
DESCRIPTION:Join us every other Thursday for a Jam like no other!\n\n🎶 S
 cott Street Gin Jam at Griffo Distillery! 🎶\n\nJoin us EVERY 1st & 3rd T
 hursday at Griffo Distillery for the Scott Street Gin Jam! The Griffo jam
  is unlike any other and we want YOU to be a part of it! Doors open at 5p
 m\, just in time to grab a cocktail\, a seat\, or load in your gear befor
 e the jam starts at 6pm!\n\nAll ages\, all skill levels\, and all genres 
 welcome! Whether you play\, sing\, or just want to kick back with a cockt
 ail and soak in the http://vibes...this http://vibes...this vibes...this 
 is the best way to spend your Thursday!\n\nPLUS\, we've got "8 dolla holl
 a cocktails" ALL NIGHT LONG!\n\nMusicians: Bring your own instrument and 
 amp if you have a preferred setup. Bring your pedals\, http://horns...any
 thing http://horns...anything horns...anything you've got or hop on our h
 ouse drum kit\, grab the mic and let's rock and roll!\n\nEveryone else: C
 ome grab a seat and watch the magic unfold! Bring your energy\, your frie
 nds\, your moves and get ready to dance your way into the weekend!\n\nHun
 gry?! We've got you covered! Every 3rd Thursday our resident Grill Master
 \, Ryan pulls his rig out to the patio\, fires up the coals\, and throws 
 down for our Community BBQ & Potluck! Bring a side to share\, something t
 o throw on the grill\, or your generosity for the tip jar - 'cuz wait til
 l you try his http://ribs...and http://ribs...and ribs...and don't worry 
 we've got veggie stuff too!\n\nCome on out to make some music\, shake you
 r hips\, sip on Griffo's ever-rotating cocktail menu\, and keep the jam a
 live! See you at Thursdays Griffo Distillery! 🎸🥁🎷🍸 #ScottStreetGinJam
  #LiveMusic #GriffoDistillery\n\nAs featured in The Bohemian & Argus Cour
 rier - Thank You Don Lewis & David Templeton!!\n\nPlease RSVP for this FR
 EE\, All Ages Event!
CATEGORIES:featured
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/66a176f54da645
 42918f1357/697819762c97af2cfcb860f8/scaled_896.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Join us every other Thursday for a Jam like no other
 ! 🎶 Scott Street Gin Jam at Griffo Distillery! 🎶 Join us EVERY 1st & 3r
 d Thursday at Griffo Distillery...
X-TKF-PROMOTION-BUTTON;label=Please RSVP;skip_details=false:https://www.e
 ventbrite.com/e/scott-street-gin-jam-1st-3rd-thursdays-every-month-ticket
 s-1981071256457
